# {{SYSTEM_NAME}} Design-System Agents — Claude Code Handoff

Orchestration layer for the {{SYSTEM_NAME}} **design-system** role agents. This context revolves around the
design system only: maintaining the {{SYSTEM_NAME}} SOURCE and the brand identity that feeds it. **Screen
creation and live prototyping live in a separate context** (see the last section). Complements —
does not replace — `CONTEXT.md` / `CLAUDE.md` (project facts + working preferences) and `DESIGN.md`
(design principles + benchmarks).

---

## Install

`.claude/` (the `ds-steward`, `component-designer`, + `brand-designer` agents and the
`/design-system-check`, `/binding-audit`, `/drift-check` commands) and `DESIGN.md` are **committed to this repo** — a fresh
clone already has the roster, no copy step. (`/agents` opens an interactive panel inside a terminal
Claude Code session to verify.)

The screen-creation roster (`ux-designer`, `ui-designer`, `flow-reviewer`, `consumer-migrator` +
`/design-review`, `/consumer-audit`, `/rebind` + the screen-review / rebind skills) is
**not installed here** — it lives in the separate **`{{STUDIO_REPO}}`** repo (`../{{STUDIO_REPO}}/`).

