## The organizing principle — ownership, not job titles

Three roles in this context, each owning a distinct **write-surface** and **object type**, so they
never collide.

| Role | Write surface | Owns (object type) |
|---|---|---|
| `ds-steward` | {{SYSTEM_NAME}} SOURCE **variables + styles** + the context repo | tokens / token architecture · governance · the binding-audit GATE · publish · drift · manifest · docs of record |
| `component-designer` | {{SYSTEM_NAME}} SOURCE **component / component_set nodes** | component construction · variants · states · layout · visual craft · binding to tokens |
| `brand-designer` | IDENTITY + expressive assets (illustration / photo / video / marketing) | how the brand looks and feels (DIRECTION) |

**Mental model:** Brand decides identity → `ds-steward` encodes it as semantic tokens →
`component-designer` builds + binds the components → `ds-steward` audits + publishes →
(handoff) the separate screen-creation context applies it.

